OL,3,APentagon backs war memorial guard who
OL,4,Areprimanded Hegseth's group
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Pentagon has given its backing to a
OL,7,FUS Army guard who reprimanded a group
OL,8,Fthat included US Defence Secretary Pete
OL,9,FHegseth at the Arlington National
OL,10,FCemetery.
OL,12,FA video of the Veterans Day observance
OL,13,Fevent on Wednesday showed Hegseth, his
OL,14,Fwife, and senior advisers laughing and
OL,15,Ftalking while posing for photos in
OL,16,Ffront of the Tomb of the Unknown
OL,17,FSoldier.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
