OL,3,APentagon backs war memorial guard who
OL,4,Areprimanded Hegseth's group
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe footage showed the army sentinel on
OL,7,Fduty stepping towards Hegseth's group
OL,8,Fand shouting: "All visitors will
OL,9,Fmaintain an atmosphere of silence and
OL,10,Frespect at all times."
OL,12,FChief Pentagon spokesman Sean Parnell
OL,13,Fsaid in a statement: "While
OL,14,Fcommemorating this solemn day, a
OL,15,Fsoldier correctly and respectfully
OL,16,Freminded everyone to maintain decorum."
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
